means a human throughout this repo, so agents inferred a\n  person was required, when an agent recording a Gerrit vote attests equally well.\n- Why `[non-codebase]`: it is the missing half of a pair the vocabulary already had (`[codebase]`\n  is recognized in ADR-0043 and both classification prompts), and it resists attestation\n  laundering by construction.\n- Why `attested` alone was rejected: `SOURCE_ATTESTED = \"attested\"` is the snapshot gate\n  read-root mode meaning \"pinned to an immutable in-repo SHA\" — near-opposite sense, same\n  readers, though no functional conflict.\n- That `[operator-attested]` remains accepted and is deliberately UNDOCUMENTED, because 827 of\n  4,285 live tickets carry it in immutable event records.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] ADR 0101 exists, is Accepted, and records the four points above.\n- [ ] ADR 0043 is unmodified.\n- [ ] `python scripts/gen_adr_index.py` run; `docs/adr/README.md` and `docs/adr/.numbers/` updated.\n- [ ] `scripts/check_adr_numbers.py` and `scripts/check_docs_index.py` pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/adr/0101-non-codebase-acceptance-criterion-tag.md","reason":"new ADR amending 0043"},{"path":"docs/adr/README.md","reason":"regenerated index"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d1fb-cdeb-f3cf-4cd9","ticket_type":"story","title":"S8 — ADR 0101 amending ADR 0043 to record the rename and the retained alias","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["09ea2795-f83c-40f8-9fbd-98aedb942830","80883486-4fed-49c1-b384-f53a4cb2ceaa"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787188216992127001,"uuid":"b13ffcfe-ac99-4d8f-81e0-e